Vamos começar com o consulta pedidos por codigo

https://api.magalu.com/seller/v1/orders/:code

Se for usar node 

Documentação
https://developers.magalu.com/docs/apis/orders/ref/seller-v-1-get-order-by-id/index.html

Authorization: http
name: bearer
type: http
scheme: bearer

